        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Don't worry, Hoshiguma. You should also know that Swire is trying to stabilize the situation."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Both of you are too hot-headed."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I just gave it to her straight. Lungmen's casualties are heavy, and this is the 'truth' that they're supposed to 'know.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Don't say that. It's not like you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "It's for Lungmen's sake."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "That's even less like you. You're a senior inspector, a high-ranking officer, not some politician. You've never been cut out for playing these little games."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Indeed, this is not something that a proper inspector should do, but I have no choice."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "You're just too overworked and need a good vacation."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Perhaps."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Heh... I've thought about it before."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Hoshiguma, I could use a really, really long vacation."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Sure, after we see this through. Don't die out there."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Ochre, or Spring City? How about Floria County instead? We could fit in another vacation in the time it takes to get to Ochre."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Maybe we can head back to Victoria and visit some old colleagues..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I want to take a look around your hometown."
